---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Private PDF Word Counter"
  description="Terms and conditions for utilizing the PDF Word Counter browser utility."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Last updated: September 15, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using PDF Word Counter, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. If you do not agree to abide by these terms, please do not use this service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>
          PDF Word Counter is a free, web-based utility designed to inspect PDF files locally on the client's device to extract text metric counts (words, characters, pages, and estimated reading durations). The service is provided "as is" and "as available".
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">3. User Responsibility & Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          While we strive for high mathematical accuracy in word and character parsing, variations in font encoding, scanned imagery, and ligature structures may affect count results. The service should not be used as the sole determinant for high-stakes legal contractual deadlines or judicial proceedings without secondary verification.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">4. Modifications to the Service</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify or discontinue, temporarily or permanently, the service (or any part thereof) with or without notice at any time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with standard international internet regulations.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
